{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_027say0174_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_027say0174_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0c5302332b7b3ee75559937112d6f09f938fd26fefed654683cda54b49a62a70", "ja": "どれも、百合子のおすすめだそうだ。\nきっと参考になると思う。", "zh": "听说这些都是百合子推荐的。\n肯定会很有参考价值。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
